cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SHERLOC in your research, please cite the manuscript and this software."
title: "SHERLOC: An interpretable deep learning model for longitudinal ctDNA data in survival analysis"
abstract: >-
  SHERLOC is a deep learning framework for survival analysis on short
  longitudinal trajectories of high-dimensional ctDNA measurements,
  combining a Temporal Transformer over gene-level VAFs, a Feature-wise
  Transformer over panel-level biomarkers, and a pre-trained genomic
  interaction encoder learned from large tissue-biopsy cohorts
  (MSK-CHORD).
